@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Your privacy"; }
<section class="section">
    <p class="eyebrow">YOUR PRIVACY</p>
    <h1 style="font-size:58px">A little peace of mind.</h1>
    <p>When online checkout is available, payments and written reading questions are processed by Stripe. Dawn receives the questions and contact information needed to fulfill your reading. Payment card details are handled by Stripe.</p>
    <p>Optional tips sent through Cash App or PayPal are processed by that provider under its own privacy policy. Dawn may receive the payer information and payment notes the provider shares with recipients. The payment links and QR codes open the provider’s site or app; this website does not collect your Cash App or PayPal login details. QR images are hosted on this website.</p>
    <p>The interim email form does not store your entries on this website; information is shared with Dawn when you send the email. Please avoid including sensitive medical, financial, or other private information in reading questions.</p>
    <p>Cal.com processes scheduling information and Stripe processes live-session payments through Cal.com. After payment, Dawn receives the client name, session time, and booking reference by email through SendGrid and by text through Twilio. Delivery records on this server contain a hashed booking reference and channel status, without reading questions or card details. Cal.com and Stripe have their own privacy policies. This site uses an essential security cookie to protect checkout requests. Hosting services may process routine access logs. Google Fonts may receive technical information such as your IP address when fonts load.</p>
    <p>To ask about information shared with Dawn, email <a href="mailto:dawn@dawnofthephoenix.com">dawn@dawnofthephoenix.com</a>.</p>
</section>
